<title>USA: Clinton arrives in Washington after summit.</title>
<headline>Clinton arrives in Washington after summit.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>President Bill Clinton arrived in Washington early on Saturday morning after his two-day summit with Russian President Boris Yeltsin in Helsinki, Finland.</p>
<p>Clinton, wheelchair-bound after an accident last week, flew into Andrews Air Force Base aboard his Air Force One jumbo jet and was lowered on a platform elevator to a specially equipped van for the trip to the White House.</p>
</text>
